{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#card-zh","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit 是一个面向 DSH 的工具管理插件：启动时扫描分类工具并暂存，会话中通过 load_tool 按名加载，也可依据用户消息中的关键词自动匹配。它在每个会话限制初始可见工具、注入工具名录，并把动态工具注册到会话级上下文。主要功能包括依赖预检、工具定义审查与入库冒烟、register_new_tool 创建并保存工具，以及会话销毁或工具文件删除时清理注册。适合希望减少默认工具列表、按需扩展 DSH 工具的用户。运行需要 Node.js 18 或更新版本；不要求额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:430-476","index.js:584-650","index.js:1190-1240"]}
{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#card-en","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit manages DSH tools. It scans categorized files into a stash, then loads tools by name or matches them to user requests. It limits each session’s initial tools, checks dependencies, and can review and save new tools. Requires Node.js 18 or later; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:430-476","index.js:584-650","index.js:1190-1240"]}
