{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#feature-1","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit 的功能「按需加载」：工具先保存在分类暂存区，模型可调用 load_tool 按名称把工具注册到当前会话；全局工具则加入该会话的可见白名单。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1038-1080"]}
{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#feature-2","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit 的功能「关键词自动匹配」：auto 模式在每轮请求前读取最后一条用户消息，强关键词命中一个或普通触发词命中至少两个时，自动加载匹配工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1190-1240","hooks/match.js:16-35"]}
{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#feature-3","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit 的功能「创建并保存工具」：模型调用 register_new_tool 提交工具定义或一句话意图，可先 dryRun 查看草案；正式入库后写入本地 toolbox 并注册到当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:665-760"]}
{"unit_id":"suanniniu__dsh-standard-toolkit#feature-4","repo":"suanniniu/dsh-standard-toolkit","commit":"b5d3ee0cc48704597ec16e0e31d6b1ed2d4cf5a3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Standard ToolKit 的功能「会话工具清理」：会话销毁时执行登记的注销器并清除会话缓存；pre-step 发现已加载工具的源文件被删除时，也会注销并从暂存区移除。","source":"generated","evidence":["hooks/lifecycle.js:38-54","index.js:1120-1165"]}
